# Commits

Commit a verifiable slice. Product move. Marketing strip. This rule file with its first slice.

Do not commit a rename-only, delete-only, or formatting-only diff. Fold those into the slice they belong to.

```
# BAD
git commit -m "rename dashboard page"

# GOOD
feat(client): move product app off web
```

Conventional Commits. Body lines at most 100 characters. Run `/deslop` before commit. Do not push unless asked.
